      "writtenOn": "2019-03-01T15:05:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We do set CONFIG_USB_PD_PULLUP on disconnect, which is why our fleex bug doesn\u0027t show up on multiple plugs/unplugs to port 0.  \n\nHowever, if you start with something in port 1 and unplug from port 1, the power supply reset will cache 3A for Rp.  Then, on plug-in to port 0 there will be a brief window of 3A on port 0 between this tcpm_set_cc call (which sets 3A) and the set_state call (which sets 1.5A).",
      "parentUuid": "39c7039c_9464480d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4132,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 4133,
        "endChar": 33
